Meridian Air Dispatch — active scoring constants · script v7.1 · state schema 6.3

Timing
  route factor                   x1.07
  taxi                           0.25 h
  prep (session time only)       0.35 h
  ceiling margin                 0.50 h
  overhead anchors (nm -> h)   50:0.26, 175:0.26, 375:0.26, 600:0.26

Load
  pax allowance                  230 lb
  of which baggage               55 lb
  override FA50                  235 lb (35 lb bag)
  override H25B                  195 lb (25 lb bag)

Field quality
  minimum width                  75 ft
  large jet on Class D needs     7000 ft

Scoring
  recency: in last 3             -50
  recency: in last 10            -20
  recency: never flown           +10
  region: both of last 2         -30
  region: last 1 only            -15
  region: absent from last 5     +20
  home pull: based, home         +35
  home pull: based, toward       +20
  home pull: regional, home      +30
  home pull: regional, region    +25
  home pull: regional, toward    +10
  aircraft-region affinity       +10

Fullness band (absolute, not a fraction of the ceiling)
  full credit from               ceiling -15 min
  through                        ceiling +5 min
  credit inside the band         +20
  below the floor                not offered (in-market legs and home base exempt, scored in-band)

Destination quality (airport `type` is deliberately not scored)
  runway turboprop (ft:pts)      2500:+0, 4000:+6, 5000:+10
  runway mid_jet (ft:pts)        4500:+0, 6000:+6, 7000:+10
  runway large_jet (ft:pts)      5000:+0, 6500:+5, 8000:+8, 10000:+10
  scheduled service              +4
  PREFERRED FIELDS               14 (the cap)
  military, no service           not offered unless preferred

Event market radius            50 nm (flag only, no score)
Sun window                     ±45 min of sunrise/sunset
Candidates per tail (--top)    12 default, 30 max
Default --date                 today in America/New_York
